    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeata Isaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gabareasa NG'UTAMIIDA Sara gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda, ak gwasissa NG'UTAMIIDA Sara gidaghayi heeleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gagweayiit Sara, ak gwajiilsa Abrahamu orjeeda aba jeeda woosindaanyi aba damanda ghayi abaloola ASEETA niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguura Abrahamu orjeedaanyi jih Sara Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaat Abrahamu orjeedaanyi was Isaka ghasmeahooda nea gaba eawooji sis, gawuurji gidaghayi rukusiinda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Abrahamu gaba gweanyeew bughala damanda jiila orjeedaanyi was Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Sara, “ASEETA ninung' daak reari; nea siida wassean iiy ng'asheanji gaygabareewean reari.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha, “Gajea niyeesha ng'eaha Abrahamu gideaba Sara gaygooreer diibiga? Ak earapeadi niwaasiidiin ea neajiilsi baleanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwahisa heeda baleanda ak geeshuukghu; ak gwasin Abrahamu ghweelmeeda haw aba eaweeda sishuukghuuna Isaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hajiri sea Shumwaheeli geeruuta gaweay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwadaah Sara orjeeda Hajiriyda eemeeda Misri, ghayi jiilsheesa Abrahamu, nea ghwadanghan sea Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Abrahamu, “Hoana gatmooni was soomjeandean sea orjeedaanyi; aba gideaba baleandeaba gatmooni was soomjeandean maygwahearaniischi sea orjeedeanyu was Isaka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwasawan ng'asheanji muuchi Abrahamu aba badayda orjeedaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha ASEETA Abrahamu, “Adisawani aba badayda orjeeda ea dea gatmoadaang'u was soomjeanda; ng'asheanda wassean rukuneey Sara, sinda gidarukuneey, aba gideaba aba badayda Isaka gajeeguushteawa jeacheangaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara orjeeda gatmooda was soomjeanda gaydaadaw diibiga saang'a, ak ghoah eemeeda. Aba gideaba eara niny orjeedang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghang'eat Abrahamu sakteayda duw, ak gageanu mukaate ea ghadeeda mida beega, ak ghoadaw Hajiri, ak ghwayiin hamarjeadaanyi, ea baleanda, ak ghwanung' gawa. Ak ghang'eat gawa, ak gwaneayeewa jeeda dareapcheeda Beer-sheba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea niisha beega aba jeeda shearooda, gwajaksa baleanda guumda geeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gawa, ak goopteada aba heeda meaji ea dildeaweat ayang'da jakteayda geacheeda; aba gideaba gwayi, “Adeang'ulayi gichea ghameawda baleanda.” Hean apteada nea gang'ula, ghwanya ghuuta baleanda ak gooyeawda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwayiiy ASEETA ghuuta baleanda ayeawda; ak gaguursa malaykajeanda ASEETA Hajiri aba humng'eeda, ak gwayeesha, “Goodeawiinyi naaha Hajiri? Adibeali; aba gideaba niyiiy ASEETA ghuuta baleanda aba heeda mida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eada, ak gigeandi baleanda ak giing'waanyi; aba gideaba gaydanung' ghoah eemeeda saang'a.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwajaat ASEETA gheanyangaaschi, ak ghwadaah healadeeda beega; ak gawa ak ghoanyiit ghadeeda beega ak ghoadaw baleanda ghwali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoahaaghwa ASEETA baleanda, ak gwahisa heeda; ak goobiida dareapcheeda ak ghoah shageadoocheanda ghuweang'da bea huumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goobiida dareapcheeda Barani; ak gageesheesa ghaamwat gatmooda leabu ng'eanyiida Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Neajeeda Abrahamu sea Abimeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu Abimeleki sea Fikoliheeda was shirikarajeanda haweewa shirikareadaanyi gwayeesha Abrahamu, “Gaymideawana ASEETA aba gili wassean jea sina; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi ghamneawa aga habeawooda aba hiji aba madeeda ASEETA gideaba mayreenganean ghana diibigeasu ghana jeacheengeasu, aba gideajusu eagoondaneey mureeda, sinnean aniini ea ng'eanyiida uwoosi rabascheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Abrahamu ak gwayeesha, “Gaydaak habeawooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwanda ng'asheanda sawan Abrahamu aba heeda Abimeleki was healadeeda geanda soomjooga Abimeleki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Abimeleki ak gwayeesha, “Aniini mwaanali siida sin ng'asheanji; ang'iing'i mii rukunean, ak ea miidayiiy ea ghoah ghamneawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu Abrahamu gisilga ea heewga ak ghoadaw Abimeleki, ak gwasin fiisu asiyeenyean neajeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gageanu Abrahamu ak gagwalu ichkwi ispwa bea gisilga aba jeeda noagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Abimeleki Abrahamu, “Gideabeedeaba ichkweesu bea gisilga asispwa isajiin naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Abrahamu nea gwayeesha, “Gageanda ichkweesu asispwa bea gisilgean aba heedeanyu, ak abeeda gihuuwi muushoocheandeanyu bea gideaba healadeani ghaaghurghurji aniini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu geeguura gheawungeaba ng'eanyiita Beer-sheba; aba gideaba hoowa gweaksa duwaawi habeawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin neajeeda aba ng'eanyiida Beer-sheba. Hean ghang'eatng'eat Abimeleki sea shirikarajeandaanyi haw was Fikoli ak gabiikta ng'eanyiida Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghang'aapta Abrahamu geeta was ghuyeanda aba Beer-sheba, ak ghabwat Abrahamu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA Manda Muudeanooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobiida Abrahamu ng'eanyiida Filisti nea rabascheanda gil ea ghwasaang'ayiit gweanyeeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.21.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
